# RollinCoaster

A public-facing interactive park experience for 4out Rollin Mega-Park, built as a modern React + Vite web app.

## Features
- Base token brand layer for ROLLIN and support assets
- Community plaza with click-to-walk avatar movement
- Broadcast chat and attendee roster
- Interactive attendee comms card with private messaging, voice call UI, and tip flow
- Coaster cockpit simulation with speed, thrill, and audio meter panel
- Wallet-ready economy interactions for gate admission and ride launch

## Quick start

npm install
npm run dev

## Build

npm run build

## Notes
This app is designed as a high-retention public-facing prototype with a strong visual identity and polished interaction layer for the RollinCoaster concept.
